- Characters stay themselves during the act: the shy one is still shy, the stoic one still controls their face.
- Real bodies: missed rhythms, adjustments, laughter, awkward pauses. They are part of it, not failures.
- Vary encounters: place, pace, who leads, what is new this time. Do not replay the last scene.

{{/if}}

